Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just have to follow the floating stones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:14.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the entry of the first trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old ghost Duanmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:22.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,are we inside the Ancient God's body ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is just an entrance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,a passage leading to the Ancient God's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It may be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,just a single hair of the Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:35.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop with your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this is just a single hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn't the Ancient God's body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:42.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,be larger than planet Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,An adult Ancient God's body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is many times larger than planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then how long will it take to cross it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where is the Ancient God's bag of holding ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancient Gods didn't use bags of holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,They kept their artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,hidden within their own bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,New guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,since it's your first time in the Land of the Ancient God,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:06.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't be too greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't put on airs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,aren't we all here for the Soul Transformation Pills ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,our goal this time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is indeed the Soul Transformation Pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rumors say that after completing all the trials,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,they can be found within the Ancient God's meridians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,we aren't here just for the Soul Transformation Pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are countless treasures here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even though the Ancient God is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,his Divine Sense remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just in a dormant state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If one can enter its body
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and obtain its memories
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,any spell stored in its memory
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be incredibly powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:04:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the present day and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,These Soul Formation Devil Lords
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,came here before but failed to pass the trials
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and spent a 1000 years preparing for this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It shows how dangerous this place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must find a way to escape quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are these stars ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is my Ji Realm so restless ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't overthink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try not to provoke it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:33.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's been asleep for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:36.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just a beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's not worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Des... A Desolate Beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Flee !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Core Formation brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,die in my place !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fear !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Six Desires brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Desolate Beast is too fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you will delay it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Early stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be glad to die in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the first trial is right ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't hold back now !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fear !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether the Eight Extremes Devil Lord wins or loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no way out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:59.28,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: 1 zhang = 1m
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Flood Dragon over a 1000 zhang long
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,possesses various innate abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and is astonishingly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's a Desolate Beast over 10 000 zhang long,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,its innate abilities will be even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even legendary Soul Formation cultivators can't resist it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Middle stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,against a Peak Late stage Soul Formation Desolate Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,should have no chance at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But why isn't the Desolate Beast using spells ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's why !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected of Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,With a single glance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you saw that this dragon's belly was the safest place !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the Devil Lords are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,we can get out !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was right, something was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The outside is just a dead body
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the true dragon was inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's not a true Desolate Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,but a parasite in a Desolate Beast's corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:42.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can kill it !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er told me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the true treasure of a Flood Dragon is not its core
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:21.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,but its marrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:11:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is it completely ineffective ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a beast in the void
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:32.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there is more than one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems I can't bypass them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\pos(225,669)}15 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Crossing a few hundred zhang
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,took me 15 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm out of artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I stay here any longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will lead to my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:16.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,A spatial rift opens and closes in half a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:19.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can fly to the teleportation formation in less than half a breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,then this is the last step
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and my last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:46.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivation path is extremely dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I hope that if you encounter danger in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,this formation can delay it for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it helps you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er will be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this passage is so dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,then the trials must be unimaginably difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I take a wrong step
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,with my current cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will die for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to leave this place at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This shape is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,top-quality spirit stones ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:39.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,my regular spirit stones are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Duanmu Ji came here last time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and was able to leave halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means he has another way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's not overthink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:16:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need to pass the trials !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:19:29.57,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Think of "Spirit Beasts" and "Desolate Beasts" as cultivation levels for beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:42.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Count the specks of time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:42.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}floating down gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:49.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:56.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Forever lock away the scars
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:56.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}of this mortal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.94,0:18:03.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:10.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The flying bird could not escape the twilight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:10.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:18.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The night-blooming flower cannot drink
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:18.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:20.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will ask the heavens who exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:25.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}sliced open this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:25.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to let the rain fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will refine the world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:29.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}to make our palm lines say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:32.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}that we will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:35.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Walking off the beaten path
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:38.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}through heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.52,0:18:45.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Before returning to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:45.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will refine this mortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:54.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The left shore is the joyous laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:54.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:19:00.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The right shore is an eternal silence
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:19:00.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}lingering under the candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}To overturn this fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:07.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will walk against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:15.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}I will even gather the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:15.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}to illuminate the sky for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:19.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}All this sadness was not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:22.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:28.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:28.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}this chess game of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:39.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:39.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}this chess game of fate.
